cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OralAI-DentalHealth
message: >-
  If you use this software or its model weights in your research, please cite
  this work. Replace the author and repository identifiers before publishing.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Peng
    given-names: Junjie
    affiliation: XMU
repository-code: https://github.com/PjjPjjPjj/AI_DentalHealth
abstract: >-
  Tooth-level oral lesion screening from RGB intraoral photographs. Detects
  dental calculus, caries and dental plaque via a four-stage pipeline
  (tooth instance segmentation, lesion detection, per-tooth classification,
  lesion-tooth association) producing a unified JSON output.
keywords:
  - dental-ai
  - computer-vision
  - oral-health
  - object-detection
  - instance-segmentation
  - clinical-screening
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
